  "text": "### Handling Difficult Customers  \n**Angry Customer:**\n1. Listen without interrupting\n2. Acknowledge their emotion: \"I understand you're frustrated\"\n3. Apologize: \"I'm sorry we let you down\"\n4. Explain next steps: \"Here's what we'll do...\"\n5. Follow through immediately  \n**Escalation Triggers:**\n- Customer raises voice or uses profanity\n- Complaint involves >£1,000\n- Customer requests manager\n- Regulatory/compliance issue\n- Potential fraud  \n**Action:** Stop transaction, call manager immediately  \n---",
